flowchart TD
    StartBackup([Admin triggers Database Backup]) --> ChooseTarget[Select Target Backup Directory]
    ChooseTarget --> CheckDisk[Verify Write Permissions & Available Disk Space]
    CheckDisk -- Insufficient --> AlertErr[Show Error: Insufficient Disk Space]
    CheckDisk -- OK --> FlushDB[Flush Pending SQLite Transactions]
    FlushDB --> CopyFile[Stream Copy gym_system.db to gym_system_backup_TIMESTAMP.db]
    CopyFile --> VerifyHeader{Read First 16 Bytes:\nIs 'SQLite format 3'?}
    VerifyHeader -- No --> LogCorrupt[Alert: Backup Verification Failed]
    VerifyHeader -- Yes --> SuccessBackup([Backup Verified & Saved Successfully])

    StartRestore([Admin triggers Database Restore]) --> SelectFile[Select .db Backup File to Restore]
    SelectFile --> ConfirmAction{Confirm Destructive Overwrite Dialog}
    ConfirmAction -- Cancelled --> AbortRestore([Restore Aborted])
    ConfirmAction -- Confirmed --> VerifyRestoreHeader{Is valid SQLite format?}
    VerifyRestoreHeader -- Invalid --> AlertInvalid[Reject: File is not a valid SQLite database]
    VerifyRestoreHeader -- Valid --> CloseConn[Close Active JDBC Connection Pool]
    CloseConn --> AtomicReplace[Atomically Overwrite ~/.gym-system/gym_system.db]
    AtomicReplace --> ReopenConn[Reopen JDBC Connection & Initialize]
    ReopenConn --> ReloadUI[Reload UI & Refresh Dashboard Metrics]
    ReloadUI --> DoneRestore([Restore Successfully Completed])
